  "details": "Some worlds when viewed on Quest have broken lighting or even meshes missing entirely compared to PC. See screenshots for PC vs Quest comparisons\nExamples\nDogPark:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_dfbecb47-7f43-4dbd-8192-3bb007748c46\nTerrain and tree leaves all have very dark lighting as if baked lights were black. (Terrain is also dark on pc which wasn't before 2019, but leaves are fine)\nArchery Cross Platform:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4c5b8b54-5381-4282-9e20-28aaa1642c0a\nThe bows and arrows have very dark lighting. The path and fake mirror are missing entirely.",
